# No browser testing

Do not test this site in a browser. The user tests it.

Never open the IDE browser, navigate to the app, take screenshots of it, click through it, or start a dev server (`vite`, `pnpm dev`, `pnpm start`, preview) in order to check a change.

Finish the code change and stop. Say what changed. Do not claim you verified it in the browser.

```text
❌ Start Vite, open the custom-brush modal, click through portrait and landscape.

✅ Update the modal layout, then summarize the change. The user will test it.
```
